import{_ as t,o as n,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 883 | Transcended Ones and Law · Overview — The Transcended One's Legal Status","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 883 | Transcended Ones and Law · Overview — The Transcended One's Legal Status","no":883,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Law","Legal Status","Symbiotic Constitution","Rule of Law"],"related":["40-Symbiotic Constitution General Outline","48-Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism","789-Legal Constraints and Exemption Boundaries","884-Legal Constraints on the Transcended One"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0883_模块4-超脱者与法律-总论.md","filePath":"en/0883_模块4-超脱者与法律-总论.md"}`),i={name:"en/0883_模块4-超脱者与法律-总论.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,d,u){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-883-transcended-ones-and-law-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-legal-status" tabindex="-1">Entry 883 | Transcended Ones and Law · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Legal Status <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-883-transcended-ones-and-law-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-legal-status" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 883 | Transcended Ones and Law · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Legal Status&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 40, 48, 789, 884</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-before-the-law-—-neither-above-others-nor-below-others" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one before the law — neither above others, nor below others <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-before-the-law-—-neither-above-others-nor-below-others" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one before the law — neither above others, nor below others&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world has an iron rule: the strong are above the law. A Great Emperor kills someone, it is called &quot;heavenly tribulation&quot;; a strong one exterminates a clan, it is called &quot;karma.&quot; The law governs the weak, not the strong. Heng Yuan Zhou must overturn this iron rule: <strong>before the law, the transcended one is neither above nor below — like every Myriad-Rank being, he is an equal subject before the law.</strong> This entry is the law sub-theme overview.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: the anti-predation axiom requires the law itself be the anti-predation tool; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Myriad Ranks be equal before the law; the collective ascension axiom requires the law serve ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom requires law application be traceable throughout; the law-first axiom requires the legal system be self-consistent, not distorted by personal will; the universal equal infinite law confirms all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; easygoing layabouts retain a floor and are not eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher infinity — infinite origin is inherent in all, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-forms-of-the-old-world-s-the-strong-above-the-law" tabindex="-1">I. Three Forms of the Old World&#39;s &quot;The Strong Above the Law&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-forms-of-the-old-world-s-the-strong-above-the-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Forms of the Old World&#39;s &quot;The Strong Above the Law&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="form-1-the-strong-self-legislate" tabindex="-1">Form 1: The strong self-legislate <a class="header-anchor" href="#form-1-the-strong-self-legislate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Form 1: The strong self-legislate&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Great Emperor sets rules himself; rules bind others but not himself. The law he sets is &quot;king&#39;s law,&quot; not &quot;constitution.&quot;</p><h3 id="form-2-the-strong-self-enforce" tabindex="-1">Form 2: The strong self-enforce <a class="header-anchor" href="#form-2-the-strong-self-enforce" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Form 2: The strong self-enforce&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Great Emperor is simultaneously legislator, enforcer, and adjudicator. He says you are guilty, you are guilty; he says you are innocent, you are innocent.</p><h3 id="form-3-the-strong-is-not-tried" tabindex="-1">Form 3: The strong is not tried <a class="header-anchor" href="#form-3-the-strong-is-not-tried" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Form 3: The strong is not tried&quot;">​</a></h3><p>No court can try the Great Emperor. He erred? It is called &quot;passing a tribulation.&quot; He killed someone? It is called &quot;acting on heaven&#39;s behalf.&quot;</p><p>Three forms together, the strong is outside the legal system. This is not rule of law; this is rule by people — the law is only the strong&#39;s tool to rule the weak.</p><h2 id="ii-heng-yuan-zhou-s-overturn-the-transcended-one-within-the-law" tabindex="-1">II. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Overturn: The Transcended One Within the Law <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-heng-yuan-zhou-s-overturn-the-transcended-one-within-the-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Overturn: The Transcended One Within the Law&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou places the transcended one within the legal system, overturning the old world from three dimensions:</p><h3 id="legislative-dimension" tabindex="-1">Legislative dimension <a class="header-anchor" href="#legislative-dimension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Legislative dimension&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>The transcended one does not participate in legislation (he has only one vote in the council);</li><li>Laws are made by the Anchor Council; the transcended one is also bound by laws he did not participate in making;</li><li>Once a law passes, the transcended one may not refuse to obey on the grounds &quot;this does not suit me.&quot;</li></ul><h3 id="enforcement-dimension" tabindex="-1">Enforcement dimension <a class="header-anchor" href="#enforcement-dimension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Enforcement dimension&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>The transcended one does not self-enforce. He finds illegal behavior and reports it to the Symbiotic Court for handling;</li><li>Enforcement power belongs to the Symbiotic Court and its enforcement agencies, not any individual;</li><li>The transcended one may not &quot;set up a private court.&quot;</li></ul><h3 id="judicial-dimension" tabindex="-1">Judicial dimension <a class="header-anchor" href="#judicial-dimension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Judicial dimension&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>If the transcended one breaks the law, he is tried by the Symbiotic Court;</li><li>Trial procedure is identical to ordinary beings: prosecution, defense, evidence, judgment;</li><li>The transcended one may not use force to influence the trial result — including not displaying force in court, not threatening judges, not manipulating evidence.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-the-transcended-one-s-special-legal-status" tabindex="-1">III. The Transcended One&#39;s Special Legal Status <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-transcended-one-s-special-legal-status" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Transcended One&#39;s Special Legal Status&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Saying the transcended one &quot;is the same as ordinary people&quot; does not mean he has no legal specialness. His specialness lies in:</p><ol><li><strong>Heavier responsibility</strong>: the transcended one has greater ability, so the law requires a higher duty of care from him. An ordinary person&#39;s mistake may be an accident; the transcended one&#39;s mistake may constitute negligence;</li><li><strong>Stricter evidence</strong>: the transcended one has the ability to destroy evidence and falsify records, so Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision has stricter evidence-chain requirements for him;</li><li><strong>Heavier penalties</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s damage far exceeds ordinary people, so for the same illegal behavior, the penalty standard against him is higher;</li><li><strong>Qualification-related</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s post qualification itself is granted by law; breaking the law may lead to qualification deprivation.</li></ol><p>These specialnesses are not &quot;above others,&quot; but &quot;greater responsibility&quot; — the law does not spare you because you are strong, nor does the principle of heavier punishment apply simply because you are strong; but because the consequences of your strength are more serious, the corresponding legal evaluation is heavier.</p><h2 id="iv-the-relationship-between-law-and-the-transcended-one-s-force" tabindex="-1">IV. The Relationship Between Law and the Transcended One&#39;s Force <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-relationship-between-law-and-the-transcended-one-s-force" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Relationship Between Law and the Transcended One&#39;s Force&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s force itself is not a legal problem — his having force is his cultivation result. But how force is used is a legal problem:</p><ul><li><strong>Legitimate use</strong>: fulfilling post duties, self-defense, protecting Myriad Ranks — lawful;</li><li><strong>Improper use</strong>: using force to threaten others, using force to obtain improper gains, using force to break the law network — illegal;</li><li><strong>Abuse</strong>: using force to rise above the law, using force to evade trial — serious crime.</li></ul><p>The law does not care how strong you are; it only cares how you use your force. Being strong itself is not illegal; abusing force is.</p><p>Equality before the law is not a slogan, but a set of institutions. If the transcended one breaks the law, his right to defense is the same as ordinary people — he may hire a lawyer, appeal, request evidence retrial. No one deprives him of defense rights because he is the transcended one; no one grants him extra defense rights because he is the transcended one. The court looks at facts and law, not how strong you are.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: treat the law as a tool to protect Myriad Ranks, not a tool to rule the weak</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: all are equal before the law, cutting the predatory channel of &quot;the strong above the law&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo is above the law — he himself is the law; Heng Yuan Zhou places Tang Luo under the law, he must also obey the law</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the law applies to all five Myriad-Rank-lineage beings, including the transcended one</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: legal provisions, trial records, and judgment reasons all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s legal status is &quot;equal subject before the law.&quot; He is not above others — the law governs him; he is not below others — the law protects him. He has heavier responsibility, stricter evidence, heavier penalties, but he applies the same law, the same court, the same procedure. When the strongest also must obey the law, rule of law is no longer empty words. This is the orthodox definition of the transcended one&#39;s legal status.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/40-共生宪法总纲.html">Entry 40 · Symbiotic Constitution General Outline</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/48-司法体系与裁决机制.html">Entry 48 · Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/789_模块4-制度-法律约束与豁免边界.html">Entry 789 · Legal Constraints and Exemption Boundaries</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/884_模块4-超脱者与法律-法律约束.html">Entry 884 · Legal Constraints on the Transcended One</a></li></ul>',37)])])}const m=t(i,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
